{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been tasked to take back the Dark Lands.\u00a0 Take control of Joone, Avatar of the Bloodmoon.\u00a0 Fight your way through this Hack and Slash Action Adventure.\u00a0 She must slay the barbaric hoards of the Abomination in order to bring peace to the lands.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avatar features a simple combat system, designed for the casual player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attend the shrines to access your spell book and give a unique experience to each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover allies along the way to give you aid in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore nine levels, each easy to navigate but challenging in their own way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Joone, a sexy blood thirsty dark elf with two Moon Sickles and a knack for magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rock out to an epic heavy metal soundtrack.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984490?t=1760452249","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984490/0e4608e8f6a8d89cc2ce40c85b80aa3f70af74b7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760452249","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984490/db449dcb249101d388f49a2d1084b97509b37db3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760452249","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984490/db449dcb249101d388f49a2d1084b97509b37db3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760452249","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Blood FX Spawn on damage.\r\nThe Main character is wearing a reveling outfit. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been tasked to take